# Reference directories
plattypus-psoxide
PSoXide-emulator

# `ArduRacerFx/` is vendored *narrowly*. It is the upstream Arduboy game this
# project remasters, and `tools/track_cook/convert_levels.py` compiles its 20
# legacy level CSVs into `crates/arduracer-core/src/levels.rs`. `levels.rs` is
# generated, so if the CSVs are not tracked then the generation pipeline cannot
# be re-run on a clean clone: `make calibrate-tracks` died with a bare
# `FileNotFoundError` *after* it had already rewritten the par table, and new
# geometry could not be authored at all. Upstream is MIT (Copyright (c) 2020
# Tony Mamacos, the repository owner), so committing the data is permitted; see
# tools/track_cook/PROVENANCE.md.
#
# Committed: the 20 level CSVs the cooker reads, the Tiled `.tmx`/`.tmj`
# authoring sources they are drawn in (plus the 64x64 tile atlas and tileset
# they reference), and the upstream licence. Ignored: the whole Arduboy
# toolchain and firmware (`*.ino`, `*.h`, `*.cpp`, `Extra/`), the other
# spritesheets and tile art, the packed `fxdata*.bin` blobs, and the superseded
# drafts under `Levels/Backup/`. That is 3.9 MB down to 47 files / 192 KB.
/ArduRacerFx/*
!/ArduRacerFx/LICENSE
!/ArduRacerFx/Levels/
/ArduRacerFx/Levels/Backup/
!/ArduRacerFx/Levels/*.csv
!/ArduRacerFx/Levels/*.tmx
!/ArduRacerFx/Levels/*.tmj

# `psoxide/` is NOT ignored as a whole: the SDK subset the game builds against is
# committed here, because upstream it is a *generated* component that exists on
# no remote (REVIEW.md section 1c, psoxide/PROVENANCE.md). Everything else in
# that upstream tree -- emulator, assets, docs, and all build output -- stays out.
/psoxide/emu/
/psoxide/assets/
/psoxide/docs/
/psoxide/compat/
/psoxide/validation/
/psoxide/tools/*
!/psoxide/tools/mkisopsx/
/psoxide/.components-receipt.json

# The vendored font bitmaps are `*.bin`, which the build-output rule above
# ignores. They are generator inputs for `psx-font` (see
# psoxide/sdk/crates/psx-font/src/fonts/basic_8x16.rs), so they must be tracked.
/psoxide/sdk/crates/psx-font/vendor/*.bin

# Build outputs
/target/
**/target/
/dist/
/build/
*.bin
!tracks/capetown_10km/capetown_10km_collision.bin
*.cue
*.exe
*.iso

# Git worktrees
.worktrees/
/.opencode/

# Cargo locks & temp files
.cargo-artifact-lock
.cargo-build-lock
.cargo-lock
__pycache__/
/scratch/
/assets
screenshots/

# Compiled circuit output from tools/track_cook/compile_circuit.py.
build/
